[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "专题 7 卷积求解",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            413,
            109,
            584,
            128
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点1：卷积求解：性质法",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            140,
            440,
            157
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、与冲激信号进行卷积的逆向思维",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            168,
            470,
            184
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)正向理解",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            193,
            289,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) * \\delta (t) = f (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            425,
            216,
            569,
            233
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) * \\delta (t - t _ {0}) = f (t - t _ {0})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            389,
            239,
            605,
            257
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)逆向思维",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            309,
            289,
            325
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$f(t - t_0) = f(t)*\\delta (t - t_0)$ ，即 $f_{1}(t)*f(t - t_{0}) = f_{1}(t)*f(t)*\\delta (t - t_{0})$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            331,
            668,
            351
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 42: 计算下列卷积积分。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            404,
            403,
            420
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ne ^ {- 2 t} u (t + 3) * u (t - 5)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            429,
            588,
            446
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、与阶跃信号的卷积",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            585,
            364,
            600
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "看到求信号的积分就等于求该信号与 $u(t)$ 的卷积",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            610,
            564,
            625
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f (\\tau) d \\tau = f (t) * u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            413,
            637,
            581,
            663
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例如：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            672,
            235,
            686
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t - 2} f (\\tau) d \\tau = f (t) * u (t) * \\delta (t - 2)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            354,
            693,
            640,
            731
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 43: 计算下列卷积积分。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            737,
            403,
            752
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $u(t)*u(t);$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            762,
            305,
            779
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $u(t+3)*u(t-5);$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            786,
            366,
            802
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
