    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 2: 卷积的微积分性质",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            438,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、微分性质：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            299,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "两个函数卷积后的导数等于其中一函数的导数与另一函数的卷积，其表示式为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            162,
            800,
            178
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d}{d t} \\left[ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) \\right] = f _ {1} (t) * \\frac {d f _ {2} (t)}{d t} = \\frac {d f _ {1} (t)}{d t} * f _ {2} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            297,
            184,
            695,
            218
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由卷积定义可证明此关系式",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            223,
            408,
            238
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} \\frac {d}{d t} [ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) ] & = \\frac {d}{d t} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d \\tau = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\frac {d f _ {2} (t - \\tau)}{d t} d \\tau \\\\ & = f _ {1} (t) * \\frac {d f _ {2} (t)}{d t} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            218,
            244,
            771,
            318
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、积分性质",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            324,
            290,
            339
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "两函数卷积后的积分等于其中一函数之积分与另一函数之卷积。其表示式为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            347,
            781,
            364
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} [ f _ {1} (\\lambda) * f _ {2} (\\lambda) ] d \\lambda = f _ {1} (t) * \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda = f _ {2} (t) * \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {1} (\\lambda) d \\lambda\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            226,
            371,
            769,
            408
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "证明如下",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            414,
            263,
            429
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} [ f _ {1} (\\lambda) * f _ {2} (\\lambda) ] d \\lambda = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\left[ \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) f _ {2} (\\lambda - \\tau) d \\tau \\right] d \\lambda \\\\ = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\left[ \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda - \\tau) d \\lambda \\right] d \\tau = f _ {1} (t) * \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            268,
            435,
            729,
            515
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、重点应用",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            521,
            290,
            536
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $s(t)=\\left[f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)\\right]$ ，则有",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            545,
            423,
            562
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ns ^ {(i)} (t) = f _ {1} ^ {(j)} (t) * f _ {2} ^ {(i - j)} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            389,
            568,
            603,
            590
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "此处，当 $i, j$ 取正整数时为导数的阶次，取负整数时为重积分的次数。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            598,
            731,
            614
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一个简单的例子是",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            622,
            334,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d f _ {1} (t)}{d t} * \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda = f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            644,
            643,
            680
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】在运用上式求解时必须注意 $f_{1}(t)$ 和 $f_{2}(t)$ 应满足时间受限条件，当 $t\\to-\\infty$ 时函数值应等于零。",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            687,
            803,
            730
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "4",
        "bbox": [
            937,
            967,
            952,
            980
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
